# Keep the localisation folder light in git.
#
# The raw trace files are large and reproducible from the committed scripts.
# Commit the small summaries, configs, tables, and documentation instead.
*.jsonl
*.log
*.png
*.pdf
*_trace.txt
logs/
**/logs/

# The cleaned clinician study intentionally keeps anonymised labels and case
# metadata as JSONL files.
!clinician_medreason/annotations/
!clinician_medreason/annotations/*.jsonl
!clinician_medreason/metadata/
!clinician_medreason/metadata/*.jsonl

# Generated localisation workspaces from exploratory scoring and sweeps.
_backup_not_committed/
trace_scoring/
cross_domain_natural_wrong_sft/
full_three_domain_localisation/
medreason_natural_wrong_sft/
mmlu_pro_natural_wrong_sft/
natural_wrong_sft/scores/*warmup*/
natural_wrong_sft/localisation_natural_wrong_sft_*.json
natural_wrong_sft/localisation_natural_wrong_sft_*.md
natural_wrong_sft/localisation_natural_wrong_sft_*.tex
natural_wrong_sft/localisation_start15_target_metrics.json
